Gronckles are tough. Taking down one of those would definitely get me a girlfriend. A stealthy, snake-like dragon head peeks over a rooftop, breathing gas into a chimney.
Gronckles ແມ່ນແຂງແຮງ ການເອົາຫນຶ່ງໃນນັ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າແນ່ນອນມີແຟນ A stealthy
, snakelike ຫົວ dragon peeks ຜ່ານ rooftop ໄດ້, ດູດແກັສເຂົ້າໄປໃນ chimney ເປັນ

56
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:34,400
