Night Fury! Get down! Vikings everywhere take shelter. The moaning sound BUILDS.
Night ຟິວຣີ ຫຼຸດລົງ! Vikings
ທຸກບ່ອນເອົາທີ່ພັກອາໄສ. ສຽງ moaning ສ້າງ.

