Gobber ແລກປ່ຽນ hammer ຂອງລາວສໍາລັບ axe ໄດ້.

68
00:05:28,750 --> 00:05:34,350
[GOBBER]
Man the fort, Hiccup, they need me out there! Gobber pauses. Turns with a threatening glare.
ຜູ້ຊາຍທີ່ Fort, Hiccup, ພວກເຂົາຕ້ອງການຂ້າພະເຈົ້າອອກມີ
! Gobber ຢຸດເຊົາ. turns ກັບຕາຂົ່ມຂູ່.

69
00:05:34,850 --> 00:05:40,850
[GOBBER]
Stay. Put. There. You know what I mean. Gobber charges into the fray, HOLLERING. ON HICCUP, a smirk crosses his face.
ຢືນ. ວາງ. ມີ. ທ່ານຮູ້ສິ່ງທີ່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຫມາຍຄວາມວ່າ. Gobber ບຸກເຂົ້າໄປໃນ
struggle ໄດ້, HULLERING. ກ່ຽວກັບ HICCUP, a smirk crosses his face.

70
