[ASTRID]
Stay out of my way! I'm winning this thing.
ອອກໄປຈາກທາງຂ້ອຍ ຂ້ອຍຈະຊະນະເລື່ອງນີ້

440
00:34:45,150 --> 00:34:51,150
[HICCUP]
Please, by all means. She darts off, CLOSING FAST on the dragon. The crowd above cheers her on.
ກະລຸນາ, ດ້ວຍວິທີໃດກໍຕາມ. ນາງdarts off, CLOSING
ຢ່າງໄວວາໃນ dragon. ຝູງຊົນຂ້າງເທິງ cheers ນາງ.

441
00:34:51,650 --> 00:34:57,650
[VIKING IN CROWD]
You got it Astrid! Hiccup stands and looks around. Amidst the crowd of onlookers, Stoick watches keenly, beaming with pride. He locks eyes with Hiccup, giving him a nod of encouragement. Hiccup adjusts his new helmet and forces a half-hearted smile. Unbeknownst to Hiccup, the Gronckle spots him and makes a bee- line toward him.
ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບມັນ Astrid! Hiccup ຢືນແລະເບິ່ງອ້ອມຮອບ. ທ່າມກາງຝູງຊົນຂອງຜູ້ຊົມ, Stoick ເບິ່ງ keenly
, radiating ກັບຄວາມພາກພູມໃຈ. ລາວ locks ຕາກັບ Hickup, ໃຫ້ເຂົາ nods ຂອງການສົ່ງເສີມໃຫ້ເຂົາ.

442
00:34:58,150 --> 00:35:02,700
[BACK TO ASTRID]
... as she catches her breath behind a barrier. She scowls, focused, determined.
...ໃນຂະນະທີ່ນາງໄດ້ຫາຍໃຈຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫລັງຂອງຂີດຂວາງ
. ນາງສັ່ນຕອງ, ສຸມໃສ່, ຕັດສິນໃຈ.

443
00:35:03,200 --> 00:35:05,300
[ASTRID]
This time. This time for sure.
ຄັ້ງນີ້, ຄັ້ງນີ້ແນ່ນອນ.

444
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:11,750
[ASTRID]
Aaaaaaaaaa... And as she clears the barriers, she sees that Hiccup has already laid the Gronckle out.
Aaaaaaaaaa... ແລະໃນຂະນະທີ່ນາງ ກໍາຈັດສິ່ງກີດຂວາງ
, ນາງເຫັນວ່າ Hiccup ໄດ້ວາງ Gronckle ອອກແລ້ວ.

445
00:35:12,250 --> 00:35:16,800
[ASTRID]
...aaaaaaauGGGGGHHHHHHHH! No! No! Hiccup shrugs, as unhappy with the situation as she is.
...aaaaaaauGGGGGGHHHHHH! ບໍ່!ບໍ່! Hiccup
ຍິ້ມຂາ, ບໍ່ພໍໃຈກັບສະຖານະການເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບນາງ.

446
00:35:17,300 --> 00:35:23,300
[MUNGE BUCKET!]
A loud CLACK ring out. From the crowd above, Gothi, the village elder, steps forward, tapping her staff. Everyone lights up excitedly.
ສຽງ CLACK ສຽງດັງອອກມາ. ຈາກຝູງຊົນຂ້າງເທິງ, Gothi, ຜູ້ເຖົ້າແກ່ຂອງບ້ານ
, ກ້າວໄປຂ້າງ ຫນ້າ, ແຕະຄໍຂອງນາງ. ທຸກຄົນຈະສົດໃສດ້ວຍຄວາມຕື່ນເຕັ້ນ.

447
00:35:23,800 --> 00:35:25,800
[STOICK]
Wait! Wait!
ລໍຖ້າ!

448
00:35:26,300 --> 00:35:29,800
[HICCUP]
So, later. Gobber snags Hiccup as he attempts to leave.
ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຕໍ່ມາ, Gobber ຈັບ Hiccup ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາວພະຍາຍາມອອກຈາກ.

449
00:35:30,300 --> 00:35:32,300
[GOBBER]
Not so fast.
ບໍ່ໄວປານໃດ.

450
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:34,800
[HICCUP]
I'm kinda late for--
ຂ້ອຍຊ້າໄປແລ້ວ...

451
00:35:35,300 --> 00:35:40,550
[ASTRID]
What? Late for what exactly? Stoick holds out his hands to silence the jabbering crowd.
ຊ້າ ສໍາ ລັບຫຍັງແທ້ໆ Stoick ຍືດມືເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຝູງຊົນທີ່ຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອງຽບ

452
00:35:41,050 --> 00:35:47,050
[STOICK]
Okay quiet down. The elder has decided. Thrilled, Gobber stands behind Hiccup and Astrid. He points to Astrid as the crowd waits in silent anticipation. Gothi shakes her head 'no.' The crowd 'Oooohs.' Gobber then points to Hiccup. The elder nods an affirmative 'yes.' The crowd erupts in cheers. Astrid turns a seething, deadly glare on Hiccup.
ດີງຽບ. ຜູ້ເຖົ້າໄດ້ຕັດສິນໃຈ. ມີຄວາມຕື່ນເຕັ້ນ, Gobber ຢືນຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ Hiccup ແລະ Astrid. ລາວຊີ້ໃຫ້ Astrid ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຝູງຊົນລໍຖ້າຢ່າງງຽບສະຫງົບ. Gothi
ຍົກຫົວອອກ'ບໍ່'. ຝູງຊົນ'Oooohs'. Gobber ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຊີ້ໄປຫາ Hickup. ຜູ້ໃຫຍ່ຍິ້ມຄໍາວ່າ'ແມ່ນແລ້ວ.' ຝູງຄົນກໍ່ພາກັນຮ້ອງໄຫ້. Astrid ມຸມມອງເບິ່ງ Hickup ຢ່າງປັ່ນປ່ວນ.

453
00:35:47,550 --> 00:35:52,100
[GOBBER]
You've done it! You've done it, Hiccup! You get to kill the dragon!
ເຈົ້າໄດ້ເຮັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າໄດ້ ເຮັດແລ້ວ, Hiccup ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຂ້າຊ້າງ!

454
00:35:52,600 --> 00:35:58,600
[STOICK]
Ha, ha! That's my boy! Hiccup is hoisted onto the recruits' shoulders and carried out to the cheering spectators...
ຮາ, ຮາ! ນັ້ນແມ່ນເດັກຊາຍຂອງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ! Hiccup ຖືກຍົກຂຶ້ນໃສ່ແຂນຂອງ
recruits ແລະປະຕິບັດໃຫ້ spectators cheering...

455
00:35:59,100 --> 00:36:02,950
[HICCUP]
Heh, heh. Oh yeah! Yes! I can't wait. I am so...
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ ແມ່ນແລ້ວ ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ສາມາດລໍຖ້າໄດ້ ຂ້ອຍແມ່ນ...

456
00:36:03,450 --> 00:36:09,450
[HICCUP]
... leaving. We're leaving. Let's pack up. Looks like you and me are taking a little vacation, forever. Toothless is nowhere in sight. Hiccup sets down his basket and opens it up, his head clouded with troubles.
...ອອກໄປ ພວກເຮົາກໍາລັງອອກໄປ ໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າເຈົ້າແລະຂ້ອຍ ກໍາ ລັງພັກຜ່ອນເລັກນ້ອຍ, ຕະຫຼອດໄປ
. Toothless ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີບ່ອນເບິ່ງເຫັນ. Hiccup ວາງກະຕ່າລົງແລະເປີດມັນ, ຫົວຂອງເຂົາ clouded ກັບບັນຫາ.

457
00:36:09,950 --> 00:36:15,950
[HICCUP]
Oh..man... SHINK! Hiccup looks up to the sound of... ASTRID, sitting on the rock right in front of him, sharpening her axe.
ໂອ້... ຜູ້ຊາຍ... SHINK! Hiccup ເບິ່ງຂຶ້ນກັບສຽງຂອງ...
ASTRID, ນັ່ງຢູ່ເທິງຫີນຕໍ່ຫນ້າລາວ, sharpening axe ຂອງນາງ.

458
00:36:16,450 --> 00:36:18,450
[HICCUP]
Aggh! What the--
ອັນໃດ...

459
00:36:18,950 --> 00:36:24,950
[ASTRID]
I want to know what's going on. No one just gets as good as you do. Especially you. Start talking! Are you training with someone?
ຂ້ອຍຢາກຮູ້ວ່າມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ ບໍ່ມີໃຜຈະໄດ້ດີເທົ່າທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດ
ໂດຍສະເພາະທ່ານ ເລີ່ມເວົ້າ! ທ່ານກໍາລັງຝຶກອົບຮົມກັບໃຜ?

460
00:36:25,450 --> 00:36:28,250
[HICCUP]
Uh...training? She grabs him by his odd-looking harness.
Uh...ການຝຶກອົບຮົມ? ນາງຈັບລາວໂດຍສາຍແອວທີ່ເບິ່ງແປກ.

461
00:36:28,750 --> 00:36:30,750
[ASTRID]
It better not involve... this.
ມັນດີກວ່າ ຈະບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ... ກັບສິ່ງນີ້.

462
00:36:31,250 --> 00:36:37,250
[HICCUP]
I know this looks really bad, but you see...this is, uh... They hear a RUSTLE coming from the other side of the cove. Astrid DROPS Hiccup to the ground and sets off to investigate.
ຂ້ອຍຮູ້ວ່າມັນເບິ່ງບໍ່ດີແທ້ໆ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າເບິ່ງ... ນີ້ແມ່ນ, uh... ພວກເຂົາໄດ້ຍິນສຽງ
RUSTLE ມາຈາກອີກດ້ານຫນຶ່ງຂອງ cove. Astrid ປ່ອຍ Hiccup ລົງພື້ນແລະອອກໄປເພື່ອສືບສວນ.

463
00:36:37,750 --> 00:36:43,750
[HICCUP]
You're right! You're right. I'm through with the lies. I've been making... outfits. So you got me. It's time everyone knew. Drag me back. Go ahead. Here we go. He puts her hand back on his harness, getting her to 'drag him back.' Astrid BENDS Hiccups hand backwards, driving him down.
ເຈົ້າຖືກຕ້ອງ! ເຈົ້າຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ສິ້ນສຸດການຂີ້ຕົວະ. ຂ້ອຍ ກໍາ ລັງເຮັດ... ເຄື່ອງນຸ່ງຫົ່ມ. ສະນັ້ນເຈົ້າໄດ້ຂ້ອຍ. ມັນເຖິງເວລາແລ້ວທີ່ທຸກຄົນຮູ້
. ດຶງຂ້ອຍກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນ. ຕໍ່ໄປ. ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້. ລາວເອົາມືຂອງນາງໃສ່ສາຍແອວຂອງລາວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ລາວດຶງລາວກັບຄືນ. Astrid BENDS Hiccup ມືກັບຄືນ, ຂັບລາວລົງ.

464
00:36:44,250 --> 00:36:46,350
[HICCUP]
AAAAUUGGGHHH! Why would you do that?!
AAAAUUGGGHHH! ເປັນຫຍັງເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງເຮັດແບບນັ້ນ?!

465
00:36:46,850 --> 00:36:52,450
[ASTRID]
That's for the lies. Astrid pounces the hilt of her axe off of Hiccup's laid-out body.
ນັ້ນແມ່ນສໍາລັບການຕົວະ Astrid ຖິ້ມມືຂອງ axe
ຂອງນາງອອກຈາກ Hiccup ຂອງຮ່າງກາຍ laid ອອກ.

466
00:36:52,950 --> 00:36:58,950
[ASTRID]
And THAT'S for everything else. Hiccup's YELP is answered with A GROWL, coming from the other side of the cove. Astrid looks up to see... A NIGHT FURY. Toothless pounces toward them, snarling.
ແລະນັ້ນແມ່ນສໍາລັບທຸກສິ່ງອື່ນໆ. YELP ຂອງ Hiccup ໄດ້ຕອບກັບ A GROWL, ມາຈາກອີກດ້ານຫນຶ່ງຂອງ cove
ໄດ້. Astrid ເບິ່ງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເບິ່ງ... A NIGHT ຟິວຣີ. toothless ບຸກເຂົ້າຫາພວກເຂົາ, grunting.

467
00:36:59,450 --> 00:37:01,550
[HICCUP]
Oh man. She dives onto Hiccup.
ໂອ້ ຜູ້ຊາຍ, ນາງຈົມໃສ່ Hiccup.

468
00:37:02,050 --> 00:37:06,600
[ASTRID]
Get down! Run! Run! Astrid pulls her axe, ready to take on Toothless.
ຫຼຸດລົງ! ແລ່ນ!ແລ່ນ! Astrid ດຶງ axe
ຂອງນາງ, ກຽມພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຮັບເອົາ Toothless.

469
00:37:07,100 --> 00:37:09,100
[HICCUP]
No!
ບໍ່!

470
00:37:09,600 --> 00:37:15,200
[HICCUP]
No. It's okay! It's okay... Toothless pulls up short and lands hard, SPRAYING Astrid with sand.
ບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ, ມັນບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ... Toothless
ຈັບເຂົ້າມາສັ້ນແລະລົງທືນແຂງ, spraying Astrid ກັບດິນຊາຍ.

471
00:37:15,700 --> 00:37:21,700
[HICCUP]
She's a friend. Toothless snorts in disagreement. Astrid is frozen. Toothless looks from her to Hiccup and back to her, confused.
ນາງເປັນຫມູ່ເພື່ອນ ຄົນບໍ່ມີແຂ້ວດັງດັງໃນຄວາມຂັດແຍ້ງ Astrid
ແມ່ນ frozen ຈາກນາງໄປຫາ Hiccup ແລະກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນຂອງນາງ, ສັບສົນ

472
00:37:22,200 --> 00:37:24,200
[HICCUP]
You just scared him.
ເຈົ້າພຽງແຕ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ລາວຢ້ານ.

473
00:37:24,700 --> 00:37:27,850
[ASTRID]
I scared him!? Hiccup makes a “be quiet” motion.
ຂ້ອຍເຮັດໃຫ້ລາວຢ້ານ!! Hiccup ເຮັດການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ"ງຽບ"

474
00:37:28,350 --> 00:37:30,350
[ASTRID]
Who is him?
ລາວແມ່ນໃຜ?

475
00:37:30,850 --> 00:37:36,850
[HICCUP.]
Astrid, Toothless. Toothless, Astrid. Astrid backs away, eyeing Hiccup and Toothless together with pure disgust. She turns and RUNS for the village.
Astrid, Toothless. Astrid ຖອຍຫລັງ, ເບິ່ງ Hiccup ແລະ Touthless
ພ້ອມກັນດ້ວຍຄວາມກຽດຊັງທີ່ບໍລິສຸດ. ນາງຫັນແລະແລ່ນໄປຫາບ້ານ.

476
00:37:37,350 --> 00:37:40,500
[HICCUP]
We're dead. Satisfied with Astrid's departure, Toothless turns away.
ພວກເຮົາຍັງຕາຍແລ້ວ.ພໍໃຈກັບການເດີນທາງຂອງ Astrid, Toothless ຫັນໄປ.

477
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:43,100
[HICCUP]
Where do you think you're going?
ເຈົ້າຄິດວ່າຈະໄປໃສ?

478
00:37:43,600 --> 00:37:46,050
[ASTRID]
Oh great Odin's ghost, this is it!
ໂອ້ ຈິດວິນຍານອັນຍິ່ງໃຫຍ່ຂອງໂອດີນ, ນີ້ແມ່ນມັນ!

479
00:37:46,550 --> 00:37:48,650
[ASTRID]
Hiccup! Get me down from here!
Hiccup ເອົາຂ້ອຍລົງຈາກບ່ອນນີ້!

480
00:37:49,150 --> 00:37:52,300
[HICCUP]
You have to give me a chance to explain.
ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍມີໂອກາດອະທິບາຍ.

481
00:37:52,800 --> 00:37:55,950
[ASTRID]
I'm not listening to ANYTHING you have to say!
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຟັງຫຍັງເລີຍ ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເວົ້າ!

482
00:37:56,450 --> 00:38:01,000
[HICCUP]
Then I won't speak. Just let me show you. Hiccup extends a hand.
ແລ້ວຂ້ອຍຈະບໍ່ເວົ້າ ໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍສະແດງໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເບິ່ງ
Hiccup extends a hand

483
00:38:01,500 --> 00:38:07,500
[HICCUP]
Please, Astrid. She eyes him and the dragon, then the ground far, far below. After a moment, she swats Hiccup's outstretched hand away and reluctantly climbs over the pedal, lines, and harness. She settles behind Hiccup, avoiding as much contact as possible.
ຂໍໃຫ້, Astrid. ນາງເບິ່ງເຂົາແລະມັງກຣ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນພື້ນທີ່ໄກ, ໄກພາຍໃຕ້. ຫຼັງຈາກຊົ່ວຄາວຫນຶ່ງ, ນາງ swats ມື Hiccup ອອກແລະ
reluctantly climbs ຜ່ານ pedal ໄດ້, ສາຍ, ແລະ harness. ນາງ settles ຫຼັງຂອງ Hickup, ຫຼີກລ້ຽງການສໍາຜັດຫຼາຍເທົ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້.

484
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:10,000
[ASTRID]
Now get me down.
ດຽວນີ້ເອົາຂ້ອຍລົງ.

485
00:38:10,500 --> 00:38:16,500
[HICCUP]
Toothless? Down. Gently. Toothless leers mischievously. He spreads his wings slowly. With a WHOP, they fill with the updraft. Toothless releases the tree, tucks in his legs, and HOVERS in place.
Toothless? ລົງ. ຄ່ອຍໆ. toothless looks mischievously. ລາວເປີດປີກຂອງເຂົາຊ້າໆ. ກັບ WHOP,
ພວກເຂົາເຈົ້າຕື່ມກັບ updraft ໄດ້. Toothles ປ່ອຍຕົ້ນໄມ້, tucks ໃນຕີນຂອງເຂົາ, ແລະ HOVERS ໃນສະຖານທີ່.

486
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:23,000
[HICCUP]
See? Nothing to be afraid of. Toothless suddenly LAUNCHES straight upward. Astrid SCREAMS. The acceleration is tremendous. Every downbeat bucks the saddle, heaving them into the sky, doubling their speed like a rocket. Astrid is thrown backward. She SCREAMS and hugs Hiccup for dear life, squeezing the breath out of him.
ເຫັນບໍ່? ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງຕ້ອງຢ້ານ. Toothless ຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນ LAUNCHED ໂດຍກົງຂຶ້ນ. Astrid screams. ການເລັ່ງແມ່ນ tremendous. ທຸກໆ downbeat bucks saddle ໄດ້, rocketing
ໃຫ້ເຂົາເຈົ້າຂຶ້ນສູ່ສະຫວັນ, doubling ຄວາມໄວຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າຄືກັບລູກສອນໄຟ Astrid ຖືກຖິ້ມກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນ. ນາງ screams ແລະ hugs Hiccup ສໍາລັບຊີວິດ dear, squeezing ການຫາຍໃຈອອກຈາກເຂົາ.

487
00:38:23,500 --> 00:38:28,750
[HICCUP]
Toothless! What is wrong with you?! Bad dragon!  He's not usually like this. Oh no...
Toothless! ມີຫຍັງບໍ່ດີກັບທ່ານ?! Dragon
ຮ້າຍແຮງ! ລາວບໍ່ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວເຊັ່ນນີ້. ໂອ້ ບໍ່...

488
00:38:29,250 --> 00:38:35,250
[HICCUP]
Toothless, what are you doing?! We need her to like us! Toothless rockets skyward and begins tumbling head over tail.
Toothless, ທ່ານ ກໍາ ລັງເຮັດແນວໃດ?! ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ນາງມັກພວກເຮົາ
! rocket Touthless ໄປຫາສະຫວັນແລະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ tumbling ຫົວເທິງຄໍ.

489
00:38:35,750 --> 00:38:41,750
[HICCUP]
And now the spinning. Thank you for nothing you useless reptile. Astrid clamps her hand over her eyes.
ແລະໃນປັດຈຸບັນການຫມູນວຽນ. ຂອບໃຈສໍາລັບບໍ່ມີທ່ານ reptile
ທີ່ບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດ. Astrid clamps ມືຂອງນາງກ່ຽວກັບຕາຂອງນາງ.

490
00:38:42,250 --> 00:38:48,250
[ASTRID]
Okay! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! Just get me off of this thing. Astrid is defeated, her aggressive energy gone. Satisfied, Toothless relents. They level off and head up into the clouds. Astrid opens her eyes again, and looks out over a world she'd never dreamed of. She reaches out and touches clouds, pierces columns ablaze in golden hues, and floats over a vast, alien sky- scape. Her terror is replaced by wonder. She grins, despite herself. Toothless rises above a blanket of clouds...
ດີ! ຂ້ອຍ ຂໍໂທດ! ຂ້ອຍຂໍໂທດ! ພຽງແຕ່ເອົາຂ້ອຍອອກຈາກສິ່ງນີ້. Astrid ຖືກເອົາຊະນະ, ພະລັງງານຮຸກຮານຂອງນາງໄດ້ຫາຍໄປ. ພໍໃຈ, Toothless yields. ພວກເຂົາ level off ແລະຫົວຫນ້າຂຶ້ນໄປສູ່ເມກ. Astrid ເປີດຕາຂອງນາງອີກເທື່ອຫນຶ່ງ
, ແລະເບິ່ງໃນໂລກທີ່ນາງບໍ່ເຄີຍ dreamed ຂອງ. ນາງ reached ອອກແລະສໍາຜັດກັບເມກ, pierces ເສົາໄຟໄຫມ້ໃນ hues ຄໍາ, ແລະ floats ກ່ຽວກັບ vast, alien sky- landscape. ຄວາມຢ້ານກົວຂອງນາງໄດ້ຖືກທົດແທນໂດຍ

491
00:38:48,750 --> 00:38:52,250
[ASTRID]
Alright I admit it. This is pretty cool. It's... amazing.
ດີແລ້ວ ຂ້ອຍຍອມຮັບມັນ ມັນດີຫຼາຍ ມັນຫນ້າປະຫລາດໃຈ

492
00:38:52,750 --> 00:38:56,600
[ASTRID]
So what now? Hiccup groans. It's a problem without an answer.
ແລ້ວດຽວນີ້ຈະເປັນແນວໃດ? ມັນເປັນບັນຫາທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄໍາຕອບ.

493
00:38:57,100 --> 00:39:02,000
[ASTRID]
Hiccup, your final exam is tomorrow. You know you're going to have to kill...
Hiccup, ການສອບເສັງສຸດທ້າຍຂອງເຈົ້າແມ່ນມື້ອື່ນ
ເຈົ້າຮູ້ວ່າເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງຂ້າ...

494
00:39:02,500 --> 00:39:08,500
[HICCUP]
Don't remind me. A strange, unearthly din approaches. Toothless' ear plates suddenly stand on end. Panicked, he abruptly dives, dipping into cloud cover.
ຢ່າເຕືອນຂ້ອຍ. ສຽງດັງທີ່ແປກປະຫຼາດໃກ້ເຂົ້າມາ. ແຜ່ນຫູຂອງ Toothless
ທັນທີກໍ່ຢຸດລົງ. ໃນຄວາມຢ້ານກົວ, ລາວໂດດລົງຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນ, ຕົກລົງໃນເມກປົກຫຸ້ມ.

495
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:15,000
[HICCUP]
Toothless! What's happening? What is it? Toothless BARKS at him. 'Quiet!' Suddenly, out of the dense cloud, a Monstrous Nightmare emerges.
Toothless! ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ? ມັນເປັນຫຍັງ? Touthless Barks ກັບເຂົາ
.'ສະຫງົບ!' ໃນທັນທີ, ຈາກເມກຫນາແຫນ້ນ, nightmare monstrous emerges.

496
00:39:15,500 --> 00:39:21,500
[HICCUP]
Get down! Hiccup and Astrid duck. The Nightmare calls out. A Zippleback appears to the other side of Toothless, boxing him in.
ຫຼຸດລົງ! Hiccup ແລະ Astrid duck. Nightmare ເອີ້ນ.
Zippleback ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນອີກດ້ານຫນຶ່ງຂອງ Toothless, boxing ລາວ.

497
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:24,000
[ASTRID]
What's going on?
ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ?

498
00:39:24,500 --> 00:39:26,500
[HICCUP]
I don't know.
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຮູ້.

499
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:31,550
[HICCUP]
It looks like they're hauling in their kill. The Zippleback eyes them ravenously.
ມັນເບິ່ງຄືວ່າພວກມັນກໍາລັງຂັບເອົາສັດລ້ຽງຂອງພວກມັນ
Zippleback ໄດ້ເບິ່ງພວກມັນຢ່າງຫິວ.

500
00:39:32,050 --> 00:39:38,050
[ASTRID]
What does that make us? The dragons BANK and dive in formation, plummeting through the thickening fog and weaving between towering, craggy sea stacks. They emerge at the base of a massive volcanic caldera, glowing with rivulets of lava. The flock of dragons fall into rank, funneling through a crack, and zipping through a winding tunnel. It gives way to a vast, steamy inner chamber, tiered with pocky shelves. Dragons of all breeds lay about, nested in hordes. The arriving dragons fly in, dropping the fish and game into a central pit, glowing red and shrouded in mist. Hiccup is amazed.
ສິ່ງ ທີ່ ເຮັດ ໃຫ້ ພວກ ເຮົາ ເປັນ ແນວ ໃດ? ພວກ ດຣາກອນ ບັງ ແລະ ລອຍ ລົງ ໃນ ການ ສ້າງ ຕັ້ງ, ຕົກ ລົງ ໂດຍ ຜ່ານ ຄວັນ ທີ່ ຫນາ ແຫນ້ນ ແລະ ຜູກ ພັນ ລະ ຫວ່າງ ພື້ນ ທະ ເລ ທີ່ ຍິ່ງ ໃຫຍ່, ແຄບ. ພວກ ເຂົາ ເຈົ້າ ອອກ ມາ
ຢູ່ ໃຕ້ ພື້ນ ຖານ ຂອງ ພູ ໄຟ volcanic massive caldera, glowing ກັບ rivulets ຂອງ lava. ຝູງ ຂອງ dragons ຕົກ ເປັນ ລໍາ, funneling ຜ່ານ cracks, ແລະ zipping ຜ່ານ ຮ່ອມ ໂຍນ ນໍ. ມັນ ເຮັດ ໃຫ້ ມີ ຫ້ອງ ພາຍ

501
00:39:38,550 --> 00:39:44,550
[HICCUP]
What my dad wouldn't give to find this. Toothless peels away from the procession, landing on a small shadowy shelf to keep a low-profile. Hiccup and Astrid peek around, taking in the busy hive of sorts. They watch as the food continues to be dropped into the pit.
ພໍ່ຂອງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ໃຫ້ຫຍັງເພື່ອຊອກຫາສິ່ງນີ້. ເຂົາເຈົ້າເບິ່ງອາຫານຍັງສືບຕໍ່ຕົກລົງໃນຂຸມ.
ພວກເຂົາເຈົ້າເບິ່ງວ່າອາຫານຍັງຕົກລົງຢູ່ໃນຂຸມ, ແລະພວກເຂົາເຈົ້າໄດ້ພົບເຫັນວ່າມັນເປັນການລົ້ມເຫຼວ.

502
00:39:45,050 --> 00:39:50,300
[HICCUP]
It's satisfying to know that all of our food has been dumped down a hole.
ມັນພໍໃຈທີ່ຮູ້ວ່າ ອາຫານທັງ ຫມົດ ຂອງພວກເຮົາຍັງຖືກຖິ້ມລົງໄປໃນຮູ.

503
00:39:50,800 --> 00:39:52,900
[ASTRID]
They're not eating any of it.
ພວກເຂົາບໍ່ໄດ້ກິນຫຍັງເລີຍ.

504
00:39:53,400 --> 00:39:59,400
[ASTRID]
What is that? The monstrous beast SNIFFS the air, seemingly aware of them. It nears the ledge where Toothless is hiding... and ROARS. Several dragons take flight in fear.
ມັນເປັນຫຍັງ? ສັດມະຫັດສະຈັນ sniffs ອາກາດ, ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຮູ້ສຶກກ່ຽວກັບພວກເຂົາ. ມັນໃກ້ຂອບບ່ອນທີ່
Toothless ແມ່ນການເຊື່ອງໄວ້... ແລະ roars. dragons ຫຼາຍພາກັນບິນໃນຄວາມຢ້ານກົວ.

505
00:39:59,900 --> 00:40:05,900
[HICCUP]
Alright buddy, we gotta get out of here. Now! Toothless takes flight, barely evading the monster's snapping jaws. The behemoth dragon lunges for them, snatching a Zippleback out of the air instead. Toothless disappears into the winged exodus as thousands of dragons flee the caldera in fear.
ດີ buddy, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງໄດ້ອອກຈາກບ່ອນນີ້! ດຽວນີ້! Toothless ບິນ, ພຽງແຕ່ຫຼີກລ່ຽງຈາກ jawbreaking ຂອງ monster ໄດ້. Dragon behemoth ລຸກເຂົ້າມາສໍາລັບເຂົາເຈົ້າ
, snatching Zippleback ອອກຈາກອາກາດແທນທີ່. toothless ສູນຫາຍໄປໃນ exodus winged ໃນຂະນະທີ່ dragons ພັນ ຫນີຈາກ calderas ໃນຄວາມຢ້ານກົວ.

506
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:12,400
[ASTRID]
No, no, it totally makes sense. It's like a giant beehive. They're the workers... and that's their queen. It controls them. She leaps off of Toothless and runs toward the village.
ບໍ່, ບໍ່, ມັນມີຄວາມຫມາຍຢ່າງສົມບູນ. ມັນຄ້າຍຄືກັບຮົ້ວຫມີຍັກໃຫຍ່. ພວກເຂົາແມ່ນຄົນງານ...
ແລະນັ້ນແມ່ນນາງສາວຂອງພວກເຂົາ. ມັນ ຄວບຄຸມພວກເຂົາ. ນາງໂດດອອກຈາກ Toothless ແລະແລ່ນໄປຫາບ້ານ.

507
00:40:12,900 --> 00:40:14,900
[ASTRID]
Let's find your dad.
ໄປຫາພໍ່ຂອງເຈົ້າ.

508
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:17,850
[HICCUP]
No, no! Not yet. They'll... kill Toothless.
ບໍ່, ຍັງບໍ່ທັນ. ເຂົາເຈົ້າຈະ... ຂ້າ Toothless.

509
00:40:18,350 --> 00:40:22,550
[HICCUP]
Astrid, we have to think this through carefully. Astrid eyes him, incredulous.
ອັສຕຣີດ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງຄິດຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງ ກ່ຽວກັບເລື່ອງນີ້

510
00:40:23,050 --> 00:40:29,050
[ASTRID]
Hiccup, we just discovered the dragons' nest...the thing we've been after since Vikings first sailed here. And you want to keep it a secret? To protect your pet dragon? Are you serious? Hiccup stands firm, resolute.
Hiccup, ພວກເຮົາຫາກໍ່ພົບເຫັນຮົ້ວຂອງມ້າ... ສິ່ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຍັງຫາມາຕັ້ງແຕ່ຊາວໄວຄິງໄດ້ເດີນເຮືອມາຄັ້ງທໍາອິດ.
ແລະທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮັກສາມັນເປັນຄວາມລັບ? ເພື່ອປົກປັກຮັກສາມ້າລ້ຽງຂອງທ່ານ? ທ່ານຈິງໃຈບໍ? Hickup ຢືນຫມັ້ນຄົງ, ຕັດສິນໃຈ.

511
00:40:29,550 --> 00:40:31,550
[HICCUP]
Yes. Astrid's taken aback.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ ອັສຕຣີດຕົກໃຈ

512
00:40:32,050 --> 00:40:34,050
[ASTRID]
Okay.
ດີແລ້ວ.

513
00:40:34,550 --> 00:40:37,700
[HICCUP]
Just give me until tomorrow. I'll figure something out.
ໃຫ້ເວລາຂ້ອຍຈົນຮອດມື້ອື່ນ ຂ້ອຍຈະຄິດບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງ

514
00:40:38,200 --> 00:40:40,650
[ASTRID]
Okay. Astrid PUNCHES Hiccup in the arm.
ໂອເຄ, Hiccup ໃນແຂນ.

515
00:40:41,150 --> 00:40:47,150
[ASTRID]
That's for kidnapping me. Hiccup looks to Toothless for support. Toothless SNORTS, dismissive. Astrid grabs him. He braces for another hit. She KISSES Hiccup on the cheek.
ນັ້ນແມ່ນສໍາລັບການລັກພາຕົວຂ້ອຍ Hiccup ເບິ່ງໄປຫາ Toothless ສໍາລັບການສະຫນັບສະຫນູນ SNOORTS
toothless, dismissive Astrid grabs ລາວກຽມຕົວສໍາລັບການຕີອີກຄັ້ງ ນາງ kisses Hickup ໃນ cheek

516
00:40:47,650 --> 00:40:53,650
[ASTRID]
That's for, everything else. In the awkward wake of the moment, Astrid hurries off... leaving Hiccup RUBBING his cheek, stunned. Toothless hobbles up, eyeing him.
ນັ້ນແມ່ນສໍາລັບສິ່ງອື່ນໆ ໃນສະພາບທີ່ຫຍຸ້ງຍາກຂອງເວລານີ້ Astrid
hurries ອອກ... ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ Hiccup rubbing cheek ຂອງເຂົາ, stunned.

517
00:40:54,150 --> 00:40:56,150
[HICCUP]
What are you looking at?
ເຈົ້າເບິ່ງຫຍັງ?

518
00:40:56,650 --> 00:40:59,800
[STOICK]
Well, I can show my face in public again.
ດີ, ຂ້ອຍສາມາດສະແດງໃບຫນ້າຂອງຂ້ອຍໃນສາທາລະນະອີກເທື່ອຫນຶ່ງ.

519
00:41:00,300 --> 00:41:06,300
[STOICK]
If someone had told me that in a few short weeks, Hiccup would go from being, well... Hiccup, to placing first in dragon training... I would've tied him to a mast and shipped him off for fear he'd gone mad. Yes! And you know it!
ຖ້າມີໃຜບອກຂ້ອຍວ່າ ໃນສອງສາມສັບປະດາສັ້ນໆ, Hiccup ຈະກາຍເປັນ, ດີ...Hiccup, ເປັນອັນດັບທໍາອິດໃນການຝຶກອົບຮົມດຣາກອນ
... ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຜູກເຂົາກັບ mast ແລະສົ່ງເຂົາອອກຈາກຢ້ານວ່າເຂົາໄດ້ crazy. ແມ່ນແລ້ວ! ແລະທ່ານຮູ້ມັນ!

520
00:41:06,800 --> 00:41:12,050
[STOICK]
... or more proud than I am. Today, my boy becomes a Viking. TODAY, HE
ມື້ນີ້, ລູກຊາຍຂອງຂ້ອຍກາຍເປັນຊາວໄວເຄິນ. ມື້ນັ້ນ, ລາວ

521
00:41:12,550 --> 00:41:14,650
[BECOMES ONE OF US!]
CHEERS and ROARS. Astrid approaches Hiccup.
ຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບແລະຮ້ອງໄຫ້. Astrid ເຂົ້າໃກ້ Hiccup.

522
00:41:15,150 --> 00:41:17,150
[ASTRID]
Be careful with that dragon.
ລະມັດລະວັງກັບມັງກຣນັ້ນ.

523
00:41:17,650 --> 00:41:20,100
[HICCUP]
It's not the dragon I'm worried about.
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ກັງວົນກ່ຽວກັບມັງກຣ.

524
00:41:20,600 --> 00:41:22,700
[ASTRID]
What are you going to do?
ເຈົ້າຈະເຮັດແນວໃດ?

525
00:41:23,200 --> 00:41:26,350
[HICCUP]
Put an end to this. She eyes him, dubious.
ຢຸດເລີກເລື່ອງນີ້. ນາງເບິ່ງລາວ, ສົງໄສ.

526
00:41:26,850 --> 00:41:28,850
[HICCUP]
I have to try.
ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງພະຍາຍາມ.

527
00:41:29,350 --> 00:41:33,900
[ASTRID]
I will. Just promise me it won't go wrong. Hiccup can't. Gobber approaches.
ຂ້ອຍຈະເຮັດ. ພຽງແຕ່ໃຫ້ຄໍາຫມັ້ນສັນຍາວ່າ
ມັນຈະບໍ່ຜິດ. Hiccup ບໍ່ສາມາດ. Gobber ໃກ້ເຂົ້າມາ.

528
00:41:34,400 --> 00:41:39,650
[GOBBER]
It's time, Hiccup. Knock him dead. Hiccup puts his helmet on and enters the ring.
ມັນເຖິງເວລາແລ້ວ, Hiccup. knock ລາວຕາຍ.
Hickup ໃສ່ helmet ຂອງເຂົາແລະເຂົ້າໄປໃນວົງ.

529
00:41:40,150 --> 00:41:42,250
[ON THE TEENS]
HOOTING and HOLLERING from the stands.
ການຮ້ອງໄຫ້ ແລະ ຮ້ອງໂຮຈາກຕຶກ.

530
00:41:42,750 --> 00:41:48,750
[TUFFNUT]
Show 'em how it's done, my man! Hiccup locks eyes with Stoick. Stoick nods with a smile. Hiccup returns a half-smile. Takes a deep breath. He hoists a shield onto his forearm and selects his weapon from a rack of many -- a small dagger.
ສະ ແດງ ໃຫ້ ເຂົາ ເຈົ້າ ເຫັນ ວ່າ ມັນ ເຮັດ ແນວ ໃດ, ຜູ້ ຊາຍ ຂອງ ຂ້າ ພະ ເຈົ້າ! Hiccup ຈັບ ຕາ ກັບ Stoick. Stoick nods ກັບ smile. Hickup
ກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນເຄິ່ງ smile. ເອົາຫາຍໃຈຢ່າງເລິກ. ລາວ hoists shield ກ່ຽວກັບ forearm ຂອງເຂົາແລະເລືອກເອົາອາວຸດຂອງເຂົາຈາກ rack ຂອງຫຼາຍ - dagger ຂະຫນາດນ້ອຍ.

531
00:41:49,250 --> 00:41:55,250
[STOICK]
Hrmph. I would've gone for the hammer. Hiccup turns to face a bolted, heavy door. Takes a deep breath.
Hmph. ຂ້ອຍຈະໄປຫາກະດານ. Hiccup
ຫັນໄປປະເຊີນຫນ້າກັບປະຕູທີ່ຖືກບລັອກ, ຫນັກ. ດູດຫາຍໃຈເລິກ.

532
00:41:55,750 --> 00:42:01,750
[HICCUP]
I'm ready. The door bolt is raised. The crowd grows quiet... Beat. BOOM! The doors blast open with a stream of sticky fire. Followed by a Monstrous Nightmare, coated in flames. It tears out of its cave like an irate bull -- as the crowd roars and jeers. It climbs the walls and chain enclosure like a bat, hissing at the provoking crowd and blasting fire.
ຂ້ອຍກະກຽມພ້ອມແລ້ວ. ໂລດປະຕູຖືກຍົກຂຶ້ນ. ຝູງຊົນໄດ້ງຽບລົງ... ຕີ. ບູມ! ປະຕູໄດ້ເປີດຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍໄຟໄຫມ້. ຕິດຕາມມາດ້ວຍ Nightmare Monstrous, ທີ່ປົກຫຸ້ມດ້ວຍໄຟ.
ມັນແຕກອອກຈາກຮົ້ວຂອງມັນຄືກັບ bull angry - ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຝູງຊົນ roars ແລະ moans. ມັນຂຶ້ນກໍາແພງແລະຕ່ອງໂສ້ enclosure ຄືກັບແມງໄມ້, hissing ໃນຝູງ ຊົນທີ່ provoking ແລະການລະເບີດໄຟ.

533
00:42:02,250 --> 00:42:07,850
[STOICK]
What is he doing? The dragon presses closer, snorting. Hiccup extends his open hand. It snarls.
ມັນເຮັດຫຍັງ? ດຣາກອນກົດເຂົ້າມາໃກ້ໆ,
ດູດດື່ມ. Hiccup ອອກມືເປີດ. ມັນຈົ່ມ.

534
00:42:08,350 --> 00:42:14,350
[HICCUP]
It's okay. It's okay. The dragon continues to pace, focused on... HICCUP'S HELMET. Hiccup realizes, then reaches up and removes it. Taking a breath to acknowledge the point of no return, he tosses the helmet aside. It hits the ground.
ມັນບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ ມັນເປັນຫຍັງ ບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ Dragon ສືບຕໍ່ກ້າວ, ສຸມໃສ່... HICCP'S HELMET. Hiccup ເຂົ້າໃຈ,
ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຍ່າງຂຶ້ນແລະເອົາມັນອອກ. ດູດຫາຍໃຈເພື່ອຮັບຮູ້ຈຸດທີ່ບໍ່ມີການກັບຄືນ, ລາວຖິ້ມ helmet aside. ມັນ hits the ground.

535
00:42:14,850 --> 00:42:20,850
[HICCUP]
I'm not one of them. GASPS and MURMURS race through the crowd. ON STOICK, as all eyes turn to him. He's welling with upset. Hiccup avoids Stoick's glare and remains focused on the Nightmare, holding his hand out. It paces around him, calming down.
ຂ້າ ພະ ເຈົ້າ ບໍ່ ແມ່ນ ຫນຶ່ງ ໃນ ພວກ ເຂົາ ເຈົ້າ. GASPS ແລະ MURMURS ແລ່ນຜ່ານຝູງຊົນ. ON STOICK, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທຸກໆສາຍຕາຫັນໄປຫາລາວ.
ລາວກໍາລັງລົ້ນຈາກຄວາມໂກດແຄ້ນ. Hiccup ຫຼີກລ້ຽງການສ່ອງແສງຂອງ Stoick ແລະຍັງສຸມໃສ່ Nightmare, ຖືມືຂອງລາວອອກ. ມັນຍ່າງອ້ອມຂ້າງລາວ, ສະບາຍລົງ.

536
00:42:21,350 --> 00:42:23,350
[STOICK]
Stop the fight.
ຢຸດການຕໍ່ສູ້.

537
00:42:23,850 --> 00:42:28,050
[HICCUP]
No. I need you all to see this. The crowd gets restless.
ບໍ່, ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທ່ານທຸກຄົນເບິ່ງສິ່ງນີ້ ຝູງຊົນຈະບໍ່ສະຫງົບ

538
00:42:28,550 --> 00:42:33,100
[HICCUP]
They're not what we think they are. We don't have to kill them.
ພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຄິດ
ພວກເຮົາຍັງບໍ່ ຈໍາ ເປັນຕ້ອງຂ້າພວກມັນ

539
00:42:33,600 --> 00:42:39,600
[I SAID STOP THE FIGHT!]
"Dragon" DeBlois/Sanders Final Draft  02-13-2010 73. Stoick whacks his hammer against the iron enclosure, rattling the arena with a terrible reverberating clatter. Spooked, the Nightmare snaps at Hiccup's outstretched hand. Hiccup YELPS and springs backward. The spell is broken. The Nightmare reacts to Hiccup's sudden movements and blasts another stream of fire. Hiccup SCREAMS and barely dives out of reach.
"Dragon" DeBlois/Sanders Draft Final 02-13-2010 73. Stoick hits his hammer against the iron enclosure, rattling the arena with a terrible reverberating clatter. Scared, the Nightmare snaps at Hiccup's
outstretched hand. Hickup YELLS and springs backwards. the spell is broken. The Nightmare reacts to Hickup's sudden movements and blasts another stream of fire.Hiccup SCREAMS and barely dives out of Hic

540
00:42:40,100 --> 00:42:43,600
[ON TOOTHLESS]
His ear plates shoot up. Panic flares in his eyes.
ກະດານຫູຂອງລາວແຕກຂຶ້ນ ຕາຂອງລາວກະຕືລືລົ້ນ

541
00:42:44,100 --> 00:42:46,100
[STOICK]
Out of my way!
ອອກຈາກທາງຂ້ອຍ!

542
00:42:46,600 --> 00:42:50,800
[ASTRID]
Hiccup! Astrid wedges her axe under the arena gate and squeezes through.
Hiccup! Astrid ແຊວແຊວຂອງນາງພາຍໃຕ້ປະຕູ arena ແລະ squeezes ຜ່ານ.

543
00:42:51,300 --> 00:42:57,300
[ASTRID]
Hiccup! She picks up a hammer and hurls it at the Monstrous Nightmare, hitting it in the head. It turns its attention to Astrid, and begins chasing her. Stoick raises the arena gate, waving her toward it.
Hiccup! ນາງເອົາກະບອກແລະຖິ້ມມັນໃສ່ Monstrous Nightmare, ຕີມັນໃນຫົວ. ມັນຫັນເອົາຄວາມສົນໃຈຂອງມັນໄປຫາ
Astrid, ແລະເລີ່ມຕິດຕາມນາງ. Stoick ຍົກປະຕູສະ ຫນາມ ບານ, ວາງມືໃຫ້ນາງໄປຫາມັນ.

544
00:42:57,800 --> 00:43:03,800
[STOICK]
This way! Astrid makes it through, but the Nightmare BLASTS the doorway, cutting Hiccup off. It pounces on him and prepares to finish him off. Suddenly, a terrible roar pierces the din.
ເສັ້ນທາງນີ້! Astrid ເຮັດມັນຜ່ານ, ແຕ່ Nightmare BLOWS ປະຕູ, ຕັດ Hiccup off.
ມັນລຸກເຂົ້າລາວແລະກຽມພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຂ້າເຂົາ. ໃນທັນທີ, ການຮົ່ມທີ່ຮ້າຍແຮງເຈາະ through the noise.

545
00:43:04,300 --> 00:43:10,300
[GOBBER]
Night Fury! Get down! Toothless bounds over the crowd and BLASTS a hole through the chain enclosure. He flies through it and disappears in the boiling smoke. The Vikings rush to railings... in time to see a flurry of wings cutting through the dissipating smoke. Toothless and the Nightmare tumble into the clear, locked in a toothy, vicious fight. Toothless kicks the Nightmare off and plants himself between Hiccup and it. The Nightmare snarls, circling them. Toothless lunges and ROARS... causing the Nightmare to relent and back away. To everyone's shock and horror, Hiccup gets to his feet and grabs Toothless protectively.
Night ຟິວຣີ! ຫຼຸດລົງ! Toothless ບຸກຜ່ານຝູງຊົນແລະລະເບີດຮູຜ່ານຂອບຕ່ອງໂສ້. ລາວບິນຜ່ານມັນແລະຫາຍໄປໃນຄວັນທີ່ອົບອຸ່ນ. ຊາວວິເຄນແລ່ນໄປຫາຮົ້ວໄຟ... ໃນເວລາທີ່ຈະເຫັນການກະຕຸ້ນຂອງປີກຕັດຜ່ານຄວັນ
dissipating. Toothful ແລະ Nightmare ລົ້ມລົງໃນຄວາມສະອາດ, ປິດໃນການຕໍ່ສູ້ທີ່ຮ້າຍແຮງ, toothless kick the Nightmare off ແລະວາງຕົວເອງລະຫວ່າງ Hiccup ແລະມັນ. Nightmare snarls

546
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:15,350
[HICCUP]
Alright, Toothless, go. Get out of here! The crowd is gob-smacked, growing livid.
ດີ, Toothless, ໄປ. ອອກຈາກບ່ອນນີ້!
ຝູງຊົນແມ່ນ gob-slapped, ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ angry.

547
00:43:15,850 --> 00:43:17,850
[VIKINGS]
Night Fury!
Night ຟິວຣີ!

548
00:43:18,350 --> 00:43:20,350
[HICCUP]
Go! GO!
ໄປ, ໄປ!

549
00:43:20,850 --> 00:43:26,850
[VIKING]
Take it alive! Stoick grabs an axe and charges into the arena. Astrid calls out to him, panicked.
ເອົາມັນຊີວິດ! Stoick ຈັບກະຕ່າແລະໂຈມຕີເຂົ້າໄປໃນສະຫນາມກິລາ
. Astrid ຮ້ອງໃຫ້ເຂົາ, panicked.

550
00:43:27,350 --> 00:43:29,350
[ASTRID]
Stoick no!
Stoic ບໍ່!

551
00:43:29,850 --> 00:43:35,850
[HICCUP]
Dad! No! He won't hurt you! The other Vikings surround and attack Toothless. He tosses them aside like rag dolls, his eyes focused on Stoick.
ພໍ່! ບໍ່! ລາວຈະບໍ່ເຈັບປວດທ່ານ! ຊາວໄວເຄິນຄົນອື່ນອ້ອມຮອບແລະໂຈມຕີ Toothless
. ລາວຖິ້ມພວກເຂົາໄປຂ້າງຄຽງຄືກັບ dolls ຜ້າຫົ່ມ, ຕາຂອງເຂົາສຸມໃສ່ Stoick.

552
00:43:36,350 --> 00:43:42,350
[HICCUP]
No, don't! You're only making it worse! Stoick raises his hammer as he charges for Toothless. Toothless ducks and pounces on him. They tumble end over end.
ບໍ່, ບໍ່! ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຮ້າຍແຮງຂຶ້ນ! Stoick ຍົກ hammer ຂອງເຂົາໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຂົາໂຈມຕີສໍາລັບ
Toothless. ducks toothless ແລະ pounded ກ່ຽວກັບເຂົາ. ພວກເຂົາ fell ສຸດເທິງສຸດ.

553
00:43:42,850 --> 00:43:48,100
[HICCUP]
Toothless! STOP! He pins Stoick and inhales. The familiar hiss of gas builds. Everyone braces...
Toothless! STOP! ລາວ pines Stoick ແລະ inhales ການ
hiss ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກຂອງແກັສ builds. ທຸກຄົນ braces...

554
00:43:48,600 --> 00:43:52,450
[NO!]
Toothless swallows back the blast and turns to Hiccup, not understanding.
Toothless ຍິ້ມລະເບີດຄືນ ແລະຫັນໄປຫາ Hiccup, ບໍ່ເຂົ້າໃຈ.

555
00:43:52,950 --> 00:43:58,550
[VIKING]
Get him! The crowd rushes him, piling on, and taking Toothless down. Astrid holds Hiccup back.
ຈັບລາວ! ຝູງຊົນແລ່ນໄປຫາລາວ, ເກັບກູ້, ແລະເອົາ
Toothless ລົງ. Astrid ຄວບຄຸມ Hiccup ກັບຄືນ.

556
00:43:59,050 --> 00:44:02,200
[HICCUP]
No! Please...just don't hurt him. Please don't hurt him.
ບໍ່, ຂໍ...ຢ່າເຮັດຮ້າຍລາວ.

557
00:44:02,700 --> 00:44:06,550
[STOICK]
Put it with the others! His burning glare turn to Hiccup.
ວາງມັນກັບຄົນອື່ນ! ການສ່ອງແສງທີ່ເຜົາໄຫມ້ຂອງເຂົາຫັນໄປຫາ Hiccup.

558
00:44:07,050 --> 00:44:13,050
[ON HICCUP]
Being shoved into the dank, dimmed hall. SLAM! The massive doors rattle and echo. Stoick pushes past him. He paces against a backdrop of shadowy tapestries and carved pillars -- a legacy of heroes, all peering down in angered judgement.
ຖືກຂັບເຂົ້າໄປໃນຫ້ອງນັ່ງທີ່ຊຸ່ມຊື່ນ ແລະຄຶກຄື້ນ. Slam! ປະຕູໃຫຍ່ໆດັງດັງ ແລະສຽງໂຫວດ. Stoick ຊຸກຍູ້ຜ່ານລາວ
.ລາວຍ່າງກັບພື້ນຫລັງຂອງຜ້າຫົ່ມທີ່ມີເງົາແລະເສົາໄມ້ປັ້ນ - ເປັນມໍລະດົກຂອງວິລະຊົນ, ທຸກຄົນເບິ່ງລົງໃນການຕັດສິນໃຈທີ່ໂກດແຄ້ນ.

559
00:44:13,550 --> 00:44:17,050
[STOICK]
I should have known. I should have seen the signs.
ຂ້ອຍຄວນຮູ້ວ່າ ຂ້ອຍຄວນຈະເຫັນປ້າຍ

560
00:44:17,550 --> 00:44:19,550
[HICCUP]
Dad.
ພໍ່.

561
00:44:20,050 --> 00:44:26,050
[STOICK]
We had a deal! Stoick pauses to say something, but stops short. He SNORTS and resumes pacing, repeating the cycle.
ພວກເຮົາມີຂໍ້ຕົກລົງ! Stoick ຢຸດເຊົາທີ່ຈະເວົ້າບາງຢ່າງ, ແຕ່ຢຸດສັ້ນ
. ລາວ snores ແລະກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນ pacing ໄດ້, ການຊ້ ໍາ ວຽນ.

562
00:44:26,550 --> 00:44:31,450
[HICCUP]
I know we did... but that was before... ughh, it's all so messed up.
ຂ້ອຍຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຮົາໄດ້ເຮັດ...
ແຕ່ມັນແມ່ນກ່ອນ... ອິອິ, ມັນໂຊກຮ້າຍຫຼາຍ.

563
00:44:31,950 --> 00:44:37,950
[STOICK]
So everything in the ring. A trick? A lie? He stomps toward Hiccup. Stops short and points, fighting back words.
ດັ່ງນັ້ນທຸກຢ່າງໃນວົງການ. trick? ຕົວະ? ລາວ stompes
ໄປຫາ Hiccup. ຢຸດສັ້ນແລະຈຸດ, ການຕໍ່ສູ້ກັບຄໍາ.

564
00:44:38,450 --> 00:44:44,450
[HICCUP]
I screwed up. I should have told you before now. Take this out on me, be mad at me, but please... just don't hurt Toothless.
ຂ້ອຍເຮັດຜິດພາດ ຂ້ອຍຄວນບອກເຈົ້າກ່ອນນີ້ ເອົາສິ່ງນີ້ອອກມາໃສ່ຂ້ອຍ
, ໂກດແຄ້ນຂ້ອຍ, ແຕ່ຂໍໃຫ້... ຢ່າເຈັບປວດ Toothless.

565
00:44:44,950 --> 00:44:49,500
[STOICK]
The dragon? That's what you're worried about? Not the people you almost killed?!
ດຣາກອນ? ນັ້ນແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານກັງວົນ
? ບໍ່ແມ່ນປະຊາຊົນທີ່ທ່ານເກືອບຂ້າ?!

566
00:44:50,000 --> 00:44:52,800
[HICCUP]
He was just protecting me! He's not dangerous.
ລາວພຽງແຕ່ປົກປ້ອງຂ້ອຍ! ລາວບໍ່ເປັນອັນຕະລາຍ

567
00:44:53,300 --> 00:44:55,300
[STOICK]
They've killed HUNDREDS OF US!
ພວກເພິ່ນໄດ້ຂ້າພວກເຮົາຍັງຫຼາຍຮ້ອຍຄົນ!

568
00:44:55,800 --> 00:45:01,800
[HICCUP]
And we've killed THOUSANDS OF THEM! They defend themselves, that's all! They raid us because they have to! If they don't bring enough food back, they'll be eaten themselves.
ພວກເຮົາຍັງໄດ້ຂ້າພວກມັນຫຼາຍພັນຄົນ ພວກເຂົາຍອມປ້ອງກັນຕົນເອງ, ພຽງແຕ່ສິ່ງນັ້ນ! ພວກ
ເຂົາເຈົ້າບຸກໂຈມຕີພວກເຮົາເພາະວ່າພວກເຂົາເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໄດ້! ຖ້າພວກເຂົາເຈົ້າບໍ່ນໍາເອົາອາຫານພຽງພໍກັບຄືນ, ພວກເຂົາເຈົ້າຈະຖືກກິນເອງ.

569
00:45:02,300 --> 00:45:05,450
[STOICK]
--Their island? He stomps back... pointing an accusing finger.
- ຫມູ່ເກາະຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າ?ລາວ stumps
ກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນ... ຊີ້ນິ້ວ accusing.

570
00:45:05,950 --> 00:45:08,050
[STOICK]
So you've been to the nest.
ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງໄດ້ໄປທີ່ຮົ້ວ.

571
00:45:08,550 --> 00:45:12,750
[HICCUP]
Did I say nest? Hiccup goes silent -- he said too much.
ຂ້ອຍເວົ້າວ່າ Nest ບໍ? Hiccup ງຽບລົງ -- ລາວເວົ້າຫລາຍເກີນໄປ.

572
00:45:13,250 --> 00:45:15,250
[STOICK]
How did you find it?!
ເຈົ້າໄດ້ພົບມັນແນວໃດ?!

573
00:45:15,750 --> 00:45:21,750
[HICCUP]
No... I didn't. Toothless did. Only a dragon can find the island. Stoick GLARES. A moment passes, then an idea takes form on his face. His eyes flare. Hiccup watches, realizing. Stoick stomps toward the doorway.
ບໍ່... ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ໄດ້. Toothless ໄດ້. ພຽງແຕ່ມ້າມົນສາມາດຊອກຫາເກາະໄດ້. ແກ້ວຕາ Stoick. ເວລາຫນຶ່ງຜ່ານໄປ,
ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຄວາມຄິດມີຮູບຮ່າງໃນໃບຫນ້າຂອງເຂົາ. ຕາຂອງເຂົາ flashes. Hiccup ເບິ່ງ, ການຮັບຮູ້. Stoick stompes ເຂົ້າໄປໃນປະຕູ.

574
00:45:22,250 --> 00:45:25,750
[HICCUP]
Oh no. No, Dad. No. Hiccup chases after him, panicked.
ໂອ້ ບໍ່, ບໍ່, ພໍ່ ບໍ່, Hiccup ຕິດຕາມລາວ, ຢ້ານກົວ

575
00:45:26,250 --> 00:45:32,250
[HICCUP]
Dad. It's not what you think. You don't know what you're up against. It's like nothing you've ever seen. He grabs Stoick by the arm, tugging with all his might. He has no effect whatsoever.
ພໍ່. ມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າຄິດ. ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າເຈົ້າປະເຊີນກັບຫຍັງ. ມັນບໍ່ຄືກັບສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານເຄີຍເຫັນມາກ່ອນ
. ລາວຈັບແຂນຂອງ Stoick, ດຶງດ້ວຍກໍາລັງທັງຫມົດ. ລາວບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຫຍັງເລີຍ.

576
00:45:32,750 --> 00:45:36,950
[HICCUP]
Dad. Please. I promise you that you can't win this one. Nothing.
ພໍ່, ກະລຸນາ, ຂ້ອຍໃຫ້ຄໍາຫມັ້ນສັນຍາວ່າ ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດຊະນະຄັ້ງນີ້ໄດ້.

577
00:45:37,450 --> 00:45:40,250
[HICCUP]
No. Dad. No. For once in your life,
ບໍ່, ພໍ່, ບໍ່, ຄັ້ງດຽວໃນຊີວິດຂອງເຈົ້າ,

578
00:45:40,750 --> 00:45:46,700
[ME?!]
He throws Hiccup off of him, SWATTING him to the floor. Icy stillness. Hiccup stares back, stunned.
ລາວຖິ້ມ Hiccup ອອກຈາກລາວ, SWATING ລາວລົງພື້ນ.
ສະຫງົບເຢັນ. Hickup stares ກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນ, stunned.

579
00:45:47,200 --> 00:45:51,050
[STOICK]
You've thrown your lot in with them. You're not a Viking.
ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຖິ້ມສ່ວນຂອງເຈົ້າເຂົ້າກັບພວກເຂົາເຈົ້າ
ເຈົ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນຊາວໄວຄິງ.

580
00:45:51,550 --> 00:45:53,550
[STOICK]
Ready the ships!
ກະກຽມເຮືອ!

581
00:45:54,050 --> 00:46:00,050
[STOICK]
Set sail! We head for Helheim's Gate. He then notices HICCUP watching from his familiar cliff-side perch beyond the village. Their eyes meet, full of hurt and regret. Hiccup slowly shakes his head in warning. Stoick breaks the stare and turns to Toothless, fuming.
ເຮືອອອກເຮືອ! ພວກເຮົາມຸ່ງຫນ້າໄປຫາປະຕູ Helheim. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນລາວສັງເກດເຫັນ HICCUP ກໍາ ລັງເບິ່ງຈາກບ່ອນນັ່ງຢູ່ແຄມຫີນທີ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍຂອງລາວຢູ່ນອກບ້ານ
. ຕາຂອງພວກເຂົາພົບກັນ, ເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍຄວາມເຈັບປວດແລະເສຍໃຈ. Hiccup ຊັກຫົວຢ່າງຊັກຊ້າເພື່ອເຕືອນ. Stoick ຢຸດເບິ່ງແລະຫັນໄປຫາ Toothless, fuming.

582
00:46:00,550 --> 00:46:02,550
[STOICK]
Lead us home, Devil.
ນໍາພວກເຮົາກັບບ້ານ, Devil.

583
00:46:03,050 --> 00:46:06,900
[ON HICCUP]
Watching. He's powerless to stop what is happening, but won't leave.
ເບິ່ງ, ລາວບໍ່ມີອໍານາດທີ່ຈະຢຸດເຊົາສິ່ງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ອອກຈາກ.

584
00:46:07,400 --> 00:46:13,400
[ON HICCUP]
Still standing there. The ships have cleared the horizon. CRANE UP to reveal Astrid is standing behind him. She approaches cautiously and stands beside him in silence.
ຍັງຢືນຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນ ເຮືອໄດ້ກັດຂວາງຫາດຊາຍ CRAINE UP ເພື່ອເປີດເຜີຍ Astrid
ຢືນຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງລາວ ນາງເຂົ້າມາໃກ້ຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງແລະຢືນຢູ່ຂ້າງລາວໃນຄວາມງຽບ

585
00:46:13,900 --> 00:46:16,000
[ASTRID]
It's a mess. Hiccup doesn't respond.
ມັນໂຊກແຊງ, Hiccup ບໍ່ຕອບ.

586
00:46:16,500 --> 00:46:21,400
[ASTRID]
You must feel horrible. You've lost everything. Your father, your tribe, your best friend.
ທ່ານຕ້ອງຮູ້ສຶກໂຫດຮ້າຍ, ທ່ານໄດ້ສູນເສຍທຸກຢ່າງ
ພໍ່, ຊົນເຜົ່າ, ຫມູ່ເພື່ອນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ.

587
00:46:21,900 --> 00:46:24,000
[HICCUP]
Thank you for summing that up.
ຂອບໃຈທີ່ໄດ້ສະຫຼຸບ.

588
00:46:24,500 --> 00:46:30,500
[HICCUP]
Why couldn't I have killed that dragon when I found him in the woods. It would have been better for everyone.
ເປັນຫຍັງຂ້ອຍຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຂ້າທາຣັກນັ້ນ
ເມື່ອຂ້ອຍພົບເຫັນລາວຢູ່ໃນປ່າ ມັນຈະດີກວ່າສໍາລັບທຸກຄົນ.

589
00:46:31,000 --> 00:46:34,150
[ASTRID]
Yep. The rest of us would have done it.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ ພວກເຮົາຍັງເຮັດໄດ້

590
00:46:34,650 --> 00:46:36,650
[ASTRID]
Why didn't you?
ເປັນຫຍັງເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງບໍ່ເຮັດ?

591
00:46:37,150 --> 00:46:39,150
[HICCUP]
I don't know. I couldn't.
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຮູ້, ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ສາມາດ.

592
00:46:39,650 --> 00:46:41,650
[ASTRID]
That's not an answer.
ນັ້ນບໍ່ແມ່ນຄໍາຕອບ.

593
00:46:42,150 --> 00:46:46,000
[HICCUP]
Why is this so important to you all of a sudden?
ເປັນຫຍັງສິ່ງນີ້ຈຶ່ງສໍາຄັນກັບເຈົ້າທັນທີ?

594
00:46:46,500 --> 00:46:50,000
[ASTRID]
Because I want to remember what you say right now.
ເພາະວ່າຂ້ອຍຢາກຈື່ສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານເວົ້າໃນເວລານີ້.

595
00:46:50,500 --> 00:46:56,500
[HICCUP]
Oh for the love of -- I was a coward! I was weak. I wouldn't kill a dragon.
ໂອ້ ເພື່ອຄວາມຮັກຂອງ... ຂ້ອຍເປັນຄົນຢ້ານກົວ
! ຂ້ອຍອ່ອນແອ. ຂ້ອຍຈະບໍ່ຂ້າດຣາກອນ.

596
00:46:57,000 --> 00:46:59,000
[ASTRID]
You said 'wouldn't' that time.
ທ່ານເວົ້າວ່າ"ຈະບໍ່" ໃນເວລານີ້.

597
00:46:59,500 --> 00:47:05,100
[HICCUP]
Whatever! I wouldn't! Three hundred years and I'm the first Viking who wouldn't kill a dragon!
ບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ! ຂ້ອຍຈະບໍ່ເຮັດ! ສາມຮ້ອຍປີແລ້ວ
ແລະຂ້ອຍເປັນຊາວໄວເຄິ້ງຄົນທໍາອິດ ທີ່ບໍ່ຂ້າດຣາກອນ!

598
00:47:05,600 --> 00:47:10,850
[ASTRID]
First to ride one, though. Hiccup blinks. He never looked at it that way before.
ແຕ່ກໍເປັນຄົນທໍາອິດທີ່ຂີ່ເຮືອບິນ ເຮັກຄັອບສ໌ (Hiccup)
ຈັບມຸມມອງ ເພິ່ນບໍ່ເຄີຍເບິ່ງມັນແບບນີ້ມາກ່ອນ

599
00:47:11,350 --> 00:47:13,350
[ASTRID]
So...
ສະນັ້ນ...

600
00:47:13,850 --> 00:47:18,050
[HICCUP]
...I wouldn't kill him because he looked as frightened as I was.
...ຂ້ອຍຈະບໍ່ຂ້າລາວ ເພາະວ່າລາວເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຢ້ານຄືກັນກັບຂ້ອຍ.

601
00:47:18,550 --> 00:47:20,650
[ASTRID]
I bet he's really frightened now.
ຂ້ອຍແນ່ໃຈວ່າລາວຢ້ານແທ້ໆດຽວນີ້.

602
00:47:21,150 --> 00:47:23,150
[HICCUP]
Probably something stupid.
ບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງທີ່ໂງ່.

603
00:47:23,650 --> 00:47:26,450
[ASTRID]
Good. But you've already done that. Another beat.
ດີ ແຕ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດແລ້ວ ອີກຄັ້ງນຶ່ງ

604
00:47:26,950 --> 00:47:28,950
[HICCUP]
Then something crazy. Astrid smiles.
ຫລັງຈາກນັ້ນກໍມີບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງທີ່ໂຫດຮ້າຍ Astrid smile

605
00:47:29,450 --> 00:47:31,450
[ASTRID]
That's more like it.
ຄືກັນ.

606
00:47:31,950 --> 00:47:36,150
[STOICK]
Sound your positions. Stay within earshot. Shouts pour in from all directions.
ປາກົດຕໍາແຫນ່ງຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນໄລຍະຮັບຟັງ
ສຽງຮ້ອງໄຫ້ເຂົ້າມາຈາກທຸກທິດທາງ.

607
00:47:36,650 --> 00:47:38,650
[VIKING #1]
Here.
ເອົານີ້.

608
00:47:39,150 --> 00:47:41,150
[VIKING #2]
One length to your stern.
ຫນຶ່ງຄວາມຍາວເພື່ອ stern ຂອງທ່ານ.

609
00:47:41,650 --> 00:47:43,650
[VIKING #3]
On your starboard flank.
ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງທ່ານ.

610
00:47:44,150 --> 00:47:46,150
[VIKING #4]
Three widths to port.
ສາມ widths ກັບ port.

611
00:47:46,650 --> 00:47:48,650
[VIKING #5]
Ahead, at your bow.
ຕໍ່ໄປ, ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫນ້າຂອງເຈົ້າ.

612
00:47:49,150 --> 00:47:55,150
[VIKING #6]
Haven't a clue. ON STOICK straining into the fog as the calls continue. Massive, jagged sea stacks begin to emerge, threatening to rip the ships to shreds. Gobber approaches him, speaking under his breath.
ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ເທັດຈິງ ON STOICK ຍູ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນຄວັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ການໂທຫາຍັງສືບຕໍ່ stacks ທະເລຂະຫນາດໃຫຍ່, rocky
ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ emerge, ຂົ່ມຂູ່ທີ່ຈະ rip ເຮືອເປັນຊິ້ນສ່ວນ. Gobber ເຂົ້າມາຫາເຂົາ, ເວົ້າໃນ under his breath.

613
00:47:55,650 --> 00:48:01,650
[GOBBER]
Listen... Stoick... I was overhearing some of the men just now and, well, some of them are wondering what it is we're up to here -- not me of course, I know you're always the man with the plan -- but some, not me, are wondering if there is in fact a plan at all, what it might be?
ຟັງ... Stoick... ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າໄດ້ຍິນບາງຄົນໃນປັດຈຸບັນນີ້ ແລະ, ດີ, ບາງຄົນຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າກໍາລັງສົງໄສວ່າ ມັນແມ່ນຫຍັງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຢູ່ໃນນີ້ - ບໍ່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າແນ່ນອນ
, ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຮູ້ວ່າທ່ານເປັນຜູ້ຊາຍທີ່ມີແຜນການ - ແຕ່ບາງຄົນ, ບໍ່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ, ກໍາ ລັງສົງໃສວ່າຖ້າຫາກວ່າມີຕົວຈິງແລ້ວແຜນການທັງຫມົດ, ສິ່ງທີ່ມັນອາດຈະເປັນ?

614
00:48:02,150 --> 00:48:04,250
[STOICK]
Find the nest and take it.
ຊອກຫາຮົ້ວແລະເອົາມັນ.

615
00:48:04,750 --> 00:48:09,300
[GOBBER]
Ah. Of course. Send them running. The old Viking fall-back. Nice and simple.
ແນ່ນອນ, ສົ່ງພວກເຂົາໄປແລ່ນ. ການລີ້ໄພ Viking ເກົ່າ. ງາມແລະງ່າຍດາຍ.

616
00:48:09,800 --> 00:48:15,800
[STOICK]
Shhh. Stoick notices that Toothless' ear plates are at the alert, quietly reacting to inaudible sounds. Stoick crosses to the stern of the ship and grabs the tiller, moving the helmsman out of the way.
Shhh. Stoick ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າແຜ່ນຫູຂອງ Toothless
ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງ, ປະຕິກິລິຍາຢ່າງງຽບໆຕໍ່ສຽງທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຟັງໄດ້.

617
00:48:16,300 --> 00:48:21,200
[STOICK]
Step aside. Stoick pulls the ship into a turn, covertly following Toothless' head movements.
ຍ່າງໄປທາງຂ້າງ Stoick ດຶງເຮືອເຂົ້າສູ່ມຸມ,
ໂດຍປິດລັບຕິດຕາມການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງຫົວຂອງ Toothless.

618
00:48:21,700 --> 00:48:27,700
[VIKING]
Bear to port. The order is called out from ship to ship. CRUNCH! The bow barely makes it past another sea stack. Stoick continues to follow Toothless' cues, undeterred.
ຫມີໄປຫາທ່າເຮືອ ຄໍາສັ່ງຖືກເອີ້ນຈາກເຮືອຫາເຮືອ CRUNCH ປາຍເຮືອເກືອບບໍ່ຜ່ານອີກຖັງທະເລ
Stoick ສືບຕໍ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມການຊີ້ ນໍາ ຂອງ Toothless, ບໍ່ກັງວົນ

619
00:48:28,200 --> 00:48:34,200
[FISHLEGS]
If you're planning on getting eaten, I'd definitely go with the Gronckle. Hiccup turns to see his fellow recruits, watching him with folded arms. Tuffnut steps forward with a scowl.
ຖ້າເຈົ້າກໍາລັງວາງແຜນທີ່ຈະຖືກກິນ, ຂ້ອຍແນ່ນອນວ່າຈະໄປກັບ Gronckle. Hiccup
ຫັນໄປເບິ່ງເພື່ອນຮ່ວມງານຂອງລາວ, ເບິ່ງລາວດ້ວຍແຂນທີ່ໂຮມກັນ. Tuffnut ກ້າວໄປຂ້າງຫນ້າດ້ວຍການ frowned.

620
00:48:34,700 --> 00:48:38,900
[TUFFNUT]
You were wise to seek help from the world's most deadly weapon.
ທ່ານມີຄວາມສະຫຼາດ ທີ່ໄດ້ຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ
ຈາກອາວຸດທີ່ຮ້າຍແຮງທີ່ສຸດໃນໂລກ.

621
00:48:39,400 --> 00:48:41,400
[HICCUP]
Uh...
Uh...

622
00:48:41,900 --> 00:48:43,900
[SNOTLOUT]
I love this plan.
ຂ້ອຍມັກແຜນນີ້.

623
00:48:44,400 --> 00:48:46,400
[HICCUP]
I didn't...
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ໄດ້...

624
00:48:46,900 --> 00:48:48,900
[RUFFNUT]
You're crazy.
ເຈົ້າໂງ່ແລ້ວ.

625
00:48:49,400 --> 00:48:54,300
[ASTRID]
So? What is the plan? Hiccup smiles, glowing in the support of his friends.
ສະນັ້ນ, ແຜນການແມ່ນຫຍັງ? Hiccup smile,
glowing in the support of his friends.

626
00:48:54,800 --> 00:49:00,800
[GOBBER]
Ah. I was wondering where that went. A clicking buzz becomes audible, growing louder. It fills the sky, converging in one general direction. Stoick sniffs the air.
ຂ້ອຍສົງໄສວ່າ ມັນໄປໃສ ສຽງຄລິກສຽງດັງຂຶ້ນເລື້ອຍໆ
ມັນເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍທ້ອງຟ້າ

627
00:49:01,300 --> 00:49:07,300
[STOICK]
Stay low and ready your weapons. Stoick's ship suddenly JERKS to a halt as the keel burrows into shallow black sand. Stoick hops overboard, landing on a sprawling beach. The BUZZING suddenly STOPS. Above him, a craggy volcano towers into the gloom.
ໃຫ້ ຢູ່ ໃຕ້ ແລະ ກະກຽມ ອາວຸດ ຂອງ ພວກ ເຈົ້າ. ເຮືອ ຂອງ Stoick ໄດ້ ຢຸດ ເຊົາ ຢ່າງ ກະທັນຫັນ ໃນ ຂະນະ ທີ່ ເຮືອ ຂັບ ຂີ່
ຂອງ ຕົນ ຂຸດ ເຂົ້າ ໄປ ໃນ ດິນ ແດນ ສີດໍາ ເລິກ. Stoick ໂດດ ອອກ ຈາກ ເຮືອ, ລົງ ຈອດ ຢູ່ ເທິງ ຫາດ ຊາຍ ທີ່ ກວ້າງ ຂວາງ.

628
00:49:07,800 --> 00:49:11,300
[STOICK]
We're here. Behind him, several dragon-headed bows pierce the fog.
ພວກເຮົາຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງລາວ ມີດາວຫົວມ້າຫຼາຍດາວເຈາະຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ

629
00:49:11,800 --> 00:49:17,800
[ASTRID]
Uh-uh. Hiccup slows to a stop in front of the teens, with the Nightmare inches from his outstretched hand. He reaches over and grabs Snotlout's trembling hand.
Uh-uh. Hiccup ຊັກຊ້າລົງເພື່ອຢຸດຢູ່ທາງຫນ້າຂອງໄວລຸ້ນ, ມີ Nightmare ນິ້ວຈາກມື
extended ຂອງເຂົາ. ລາວ reached ເຖິງແລະ grabbed ມື trembling ຂອງ Snotlout ໄດ້.

630
00:49:18,300 --> 00:49:20,300
[SNOTLOUT]
Wait! What are you...
ລໍຖ້າ! ເຈົ້າ...

631
00:49:20,800 --> 00:49:22,800
[HICCUP]
Relax. It's okay... it's okay.
ສະບາຍດີ, ມັນບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ...

632
00:49:23,300 --> 00:49:28,200
[SNOTLOUT]
Where are you going?! Hiccup pulls a bundle of rope from a supply box.
ເຈົ້າຈະໄປໃສ? Hiccup ດຶງສາຍແອວຈາກກ່ອງສະ ຫນອງ.

633
00:49:28,700 --> 00:49:34,700
[HICCUP]
You're going to need something to help you hold on. The teens eye each other apprehensively, and look up to reveal... ALL THE DRAGONS standing in the ring, facing the teens expectantly.
ພວກໄວລຸ້ນເບິ່ງກັນຢ່າງຢ້ານກົວ, ແລະເບິ່ງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເປີດເຜີຍ...
DRAGONES ທັງຫມົດທີ່ຢືນຢູ່ໃນວົງ, ປະເຊີນຫນ້າກັບໄວລຸ່ນໃນຄວາມຄາດຫວັງ.

634
00:49:35,200 --> 00:49:41,200
[CLOSE ON]
Tree trunks, being sharpened and planted into the sand at angled rows. Boulders being loaded into catapult baskets. And a war plan being scratched in the sand. STOICK looms over it, looking determined. His generals are at his sides.
ຮາກຕົ້ນໄມ້, ກໍາ ລັງຖືກແຊ່ແລະປູກເຂົ້າໄປໃນຊາຍໃນແຖວທີ່ມຸມ, ຫີນທີ່ຖືກໂຫຼດເຂົ້າໄປໃນຈານ catapult ແລະແຜນການສົງຄາມ
ກໍາ ລັງ scratched ໃນດິນຊາຍ. STOICK loomed ເທິງມັນ, ເບິ່ງຕັດສິນໃຈ. ນາຍພົນຂອງລາວແມ່ນຢູ່ຂ້າງຂອງລາວ.

635
00:49:41,700 --> 00:49:46,250
[STOICK]
When we crack this mountain open, all hell is going to break loose.
ເມື່ອພວກເຮົາມາເປີດພູເຂົານີ້, ທຸກສິ່ງທຸກຢ່າງຈະແຕກຂຶ້ນ.

636
00:49:46,750 --> 00:49:51,650
[GOBBER]
In my undies. Good thing I brought extras. Stoick TURNS to face the men.
ໃນເຄື່ອງນຸ່ງຊັ້ນໃນ ຂອງຂ້ອຍ ໂຊກດີທີ່ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ເອົາມາເພີ່ມເຕີມ
Stoick turns ເພື່ອປະເຊີນຫນ້າກັບຜູ້ຊາຍ

637
00:49:52,150 --> 00:49:58,150
[STOICK]
No matter how this ends, it ends today. He walks toward the base of the volcano wall, back by several hundred warriors. He raises his arm and drops it.
ບໍ່ວ່າເລື່ອງນີ້ຈະສິ້ນສຸດລົງແນວໃດກໍຕາມ ມັນສິ້ນ ສຸດລົງໃນມື້ນີ້
ລາວໄດ້ຍ່າງໄປສູ່ພື້ນຖານຂອງກໍາແພງພູເຂົາໄຟ, ກັບຄືນໄປບ່ອນໂດຍນັກຮົບຫຼາຍຮ້ອຍຄົນ ລາວໄດ້ຍົກແຂນແລະຫຼຸດລົງມັນ

638
00:49:58,650 --> 00:50:02,150
[WITH DRAGONS.]
Stoick pulls his hammer and rushes into the cave, brazen.
Stoick ດຶງກະດານຂອງລາວແລະແລ່ນເຂົ້າໄປໃນຮ່ອມພູ, brazenly.

639
00:50:02,650 --> 00:50:08,650
[STOICK]
In a chaotic flurry, the dragons suddenly rush out like bats from a cave. The take to the air, bypassing the axe-swinging Vikings and fleeing the island in a mass exodus. The battle-ready Vikings drop their weapons, confused.
ໃນຄວາມວຸ້ນວາຍທີ່ໂສກເສົ້າ, ຫມີມັງກອນໄດ້ແລ່ນອອກມາຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນຄືກັບແມງໄມ້ຈາກຮ່ອມພູ.
ພວກມັນຂຶ້ນອາກາດ, ໂດຍຜ່ານການ swinging axe Vikings ແລະ ຫນີອອກຈາກເກາະໃນ exodus ມະຫາຊົນ.

640
00:50:09,150 --> 00:50:15,150
[GOBBER]
Is that it? Above the island, dragons POUR from every crevice, fleeing to the sky. The sound of screeching dragons fades.
ຢູ່ເທິງເກາະ, ດຣາກອນຝົນຕົກຈາກທຸກຮ່ອງຮອຍ,
ຫນີໄປສູ່ສະຫວັນ ສຽງຂອງດຣາກັນ screeching fades.

641
00:50:15,650 --> 00:50:21,650
[SPITELOUT]
We've done it! Stoick doesn't celebrate. Something is not right. He HEARS something. Stoick turns to peer down the dark throat of the cavern. A deep, rumbling ROAR echoes from the cavern. The ground underfoot TREMBLES. The ships rock. Their sails fill with a blast of air. The cheering stops. Stoick's expression sinks.
ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ເຮັດແລ້ວ! Stoick ບໍ່ສະເຫຼີມສະຫຼອງ. ບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ລາວໄດ້ຍິນບາງສິ່ງບາງສິ່ງ. Stoick ຫັນໄປເບິ່ງຮູມືດຂອງຮູຮູ. ສຽງຮົ່ມທີ່ເລິກເຊິ່ງ,
ຮຸ່ງຮຸ່ງອອກມາຈາກຮ່ອງຮອຍ. ພື້ນທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ຕີນ TREMBLE. ເຮືອ rocks. sail ຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍການສັ່ນສະເທືອນຂອງອາກາດ. cheering ຢຸດເຊົາ. ການສະແດງອອກຂອງ Stoick sinks.

642
00:50:22,150 --> 00:50:27,050
[STOICK]
This isn't over. Form your ranks! Hold together! The men SCRAMBLE to organize themselves.
ນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ຈົບ. ສ້າງແຖວຂອງທ່ານ! ຢືນຢູ່ຮ່ວມກັນ
! ຜູ້ຊາຍ SCRAMBLE ເພື່ອຈັດຕັ້ງຕົນເອງ.

643
00:50:27,550 --> 00:50:29,550
[STOICK]
Get clear!
ອອກໄປ!

644
00:50:30,050 --> 00:50:32,050
[GOBBER]
Beard of Thor...what is that?
Beard of ທໍ... ນັ້ນແມ່ນຫຍັງ?

645
00:50:32,550 --> 00:50:34,550
[STOICK]
Odin help us.
ໂອດີນຊ່ວຍພວກເຮົາ.

646
00:50:35,050 --> 00:50:37,050
[VIKING #3]
Get to the ships!
ໄປຫາເຮືອ!

647
00:50:37,550 --> 00:50:43,550
[STOICK]
No! NO! The Red Death BLASTS the ships like a mile-long flamethrower. The sails are torched. Vikings dive overboard and masts come down. Gobber Joins Stoick.
ບໍ່! ບໍ່! ການຕາຍສີແດງລະເບີດເຮືອເຊັ່ນ flamethrower ໄມລົນຍາວ. sails
ຖືກເຜົາໄຫມ້. Vikings dive overboard ແລະ masts ລົງ. Gobber ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ Stoick.

648
00:50:44,050 --> 00:50:48,950
[GOBBER]
Heh. Smart, that one. Stoick looks up and down the beach for an answer.
ຮາ. smart, ວ່າຫນຶ່ງ. Stoick ເບິ່ງຂຶ້ນແລະລົງຂອງຫາດຊາຍສໍາລັບຄໍາຕອບ.

649
00:50:49,450 --> 00:50:55,450
[STOICK]
I was a fool. The monster raises its head to the sky and BELLOWS. The sound SHAKES the beach, knocking Vikings off their feet. This island is his. Stoick stops a Viking General.
ຂ້ອຍເປັນຄົນໂງ່. ມະຫາຊົນຍົກຫົວຂຶ້ນສູ່ສະຫວັນແລະ bellows. ສຽງ shakes ຫາດຊາຍ, knocking
Vikings off ຕີນຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າ. ເກາະນີ້ແມ່ນຂອງເຂົາ. Stoick ຢຸດ Viking ນາຍພົນ.

650
00:50:55,950 --> 00:50:59,450
[STOICK]
Lead the men to the far side of the island.
ນໍາພວກຜູ້ຊາຍໄປຫາຝ່າຍອື່ນຂອງເກາະ.

651
00:50:59,950 --> 00:51:05,950
[SPITELOUT]
Right.  Everybody to the far side of the island! The Vikings scatter into the rocks like ants. Satisfied with the ships destruction, The Red Death turns its attention back to the Vikings. They seem to have vanished. It SNIFFS the air, searching for their scent. Gobber drops in beside Stoick, like two soldiers in a trench. Fire blasts over head, causing them to duck.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ. ທຸກຄົນໄປທາງອີກຝ່າຍຂອງເກາະ! ຊາວວິເຄນກະຈາຍເຂົ້າໄປໃນຫີນຄືກັບແມງໄມ້. ພໍໃຈກັບການ ທໍາ ລາຍເຮືອ, The Red Death ຫັນເອົາຄວາມສົນໃຈຂອງຕົນກັບຄືນສູ່ຊາວວີເຄນ.
ພວກເຂົາເບິ່ງຄືວ່າໄດ້ຫາຍໄປ. ມັນ sniffs ອາກາດ, ຊອກຫາກິ່ນຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າ. Gobber ຕົກຢູ່ຂ້າງ Stoick, ຄືກັບທະຫານສອງຄົນໃນຮ່ອງຮອຍ. ໄຟລະເບີດເທິງຫົວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາ duck.

652
00:51:06,450 --> 00:51:08,450
[STOICK]
Gobber, go with the men.
Gobber, ໄປກັບຜູ້ຊາຍ.

653
00:51:08,950 --> 00:51:14,550
[GOBBER]
I think I'll stay, just in case you're thinking of doing something crazy. Stoick grabs him.
ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຄິດວ່າຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຈະຢູ່,
ພຽງແຕ່ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານກໍາລັງຄິດທີ່ຈະເຮັດບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງ crazy. Stoick grabs ລາວ.

654
00:51:15,050 --> 00:51:21,050
[STOICK]
I can buy them a few minutes if I give that thing someone to hunt. Gobber removes Stoick's hand. Clenches his forearm, determined.
ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າສາມາດຊື້ໃຫ້ເຂົາເຈົ້າສອງສາມນາທີຖ້າຫາກວ່າຂ້າພະເຈົ້າໃຫ້ສິ່ງທີ່ຄົນທີ່ຈະລ່າສັດ
Gobber ເອົາມືຂອງ Stoick ໄດ້ clenches forearm ຂອງເຂົາ, ຕັດສິນໃຈ.

655
00:51:21,550 --> 00:51:27,550
[GOBBER]
Then I can double that time. Stoick grins. Friends to the bitter end. They BREAK COVER and dash into the open, SPLITTING UP. Stoick rips a sharpened post from the ground and hurls it into the monster's face.
ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຂ້າພະເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນສອງເທົ່າທີ່ເວລາ Stoick grins ເພື່ອນມິດຈົນເຖິງຕອນທ້າຍ bitter ພວກເຂົາ BREAK
COVER ແລະ rush ເຂົ້າໄປໃນເປີດ, ແບ່ງປັນຂຶ້ນ Stoick rips post sharpened ຈາກພື້ນດິນແລະ throws ມັນໃນໃບຫນ້າຂອງ monsters

656
00:51:28,050 --> 00:51:34,050
[NO, HERE!]
It spots both of them. He fuels up to fire, glancing back and forth between the two men. He focuses on Stoick.
ມັນເຫັນພວກເພິ່ນທັງສອງ. ລາວກະຕຸ້ນໄຟ,
ສັງເກດເບິ່ງໄປມາລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ຊາຍທັງສອງຄົນ. ລາວສຸມໃສ່ Stoick.

657
00:51:34,550 --> 00:51:36,550
[GOBBER]
Come on! Fight me!
ມາ, ຕໍ່ສູ້ກັບຂ້ອຍ!

658
00:51:37,050 --> 00:51:43,050
[STOICK]
No, me! The Red Death remains focused on Stoick - this is it. It rears back and inhales. Gas begins to amass, when... KABLAM! A BLAST explodes against the back of The Red Death's head. It turns distracted, as... ... a Nadder punches through the flames, banking across the sky. Followed by a Monstrous Nightmare, a Zippleback, and a Gronckle. They roll in unison, revealing the recruits riding on their backs. Hiccup leads, with Astrid clinging to his waist. GOBBER AND STOICK, watch slack-jawed, in awe.
ບໍ່, ຂ້າ ພະ ເຈົ້າ! ຄວາມ ຕາຍ ແດງ ຍັງ ສຸມ ໃສ່ Stoick - ນີ້ ແມ່ນ ມັນ. ມັນ ກັບ ຄືນ ມາ ແລະ inhales. ອາຍ ແກັສ ເລີ່ມ ເກັບ ກໍາ, ໃນ ເວ ລາ ທີ່... KABLAM! A Blast ລະ ເບີດ ຕໍ່ ຫຼັງ ຂອງ ຫົວ ຂອງ The Red
Death ໄດ້. ມັນ ຫັນ ໄປ distracted, ໃນ ຂະ ນະ ທີ່...... nadder punches ຜ່ານ ໄຟ ໄຫມ້, banking ຂ້າມ ຟ້າ. ຕິດ ຕາມ ໂດຍ nightmare monstrous, a Zippleback, ແລະ Gronckle. ພວກເຂົາ roll ໃນ unison, ເປີດ ເຜີຍ

659
00:51:43,550 --> 00:51:49,550
[HICCUP]
Ruff, Tuff, watch your backs! Move Fishlegs! The monster shakes off the blast and snaps in their wake. Hiccup directs his squadron out of harm's way. They climb out of reach and circle each other.
Ruff, Tuff, ລະວັງຫລັງຂອງທ່ານ! ຍ້າຍ Fishlegs! ສັດມະຫາສັດສັ່ນຈາກການລະເບີດແລະ snaps ໃນ wake ຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າ
. Hiccup ຊີ້ແຈງ squadron ຂອງເຂົາອອກຈາກທາງອັນຕະລາຍ. ພວກເຂົາ climb ອອກຈາກການບັນລຸແລະວົງກັນ.

660
00:51:50,050 --> 00:51:54,600
[TUFFNUT]
Look at us, we're on a dragon! We're on dragons, all of us!
ເບິ່ງພວກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາຢູ່ເທິງມັງກຣ!
ພວກເຮົາຢູ່ໃນມັງກອນ, ພວກເຮົາທຸກຄົນ!

661
00:51:55,100 --> 00:51:58,950
[HICCUP]
Up, let's move it! The dragons climb past the Red Death.
ຂຶ້ນໄປ, ໃຫ້ຍ້າຍມັນ! ພວກດຣາກອນໄດ້ຂຶ້ນຜ່ານຄວາມຕາຍສີແດງ.

662
00:51:59,450 --> 00:52:01,450
[ON THE GROUND]
Gobber hobbles over to Stoick.
Gobber hobbles ໄປຫາ Stoick.

663
00:52:01,950 --> 00:52:06,150
[GOBBER]
Every bit the boar-headed, stubborn Viking you ever were. Stoick is speechless.
ແຕ່ລະສິ້ນສ່ວນຂອງຊາວວິເຄນທີ່ຫົວຫນັກ, ຫົວເຂັ້ມແຂງ
