Okay, time's up. Let's see if this works. He pulls Toothless into a turn. They fly directly into the Red Death's face, taunting it.
ໂອເຄ, ເວລາຫມົດແລ້ວ. ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ ຫຼືບໍ່. ລາວດຶງ Toothless
